>## @requirement noFullCaseFoldingExpansion toUpper does not perform full Unicode case folding: a character whose full uppercase mapping would expand to multiple code points, or whose simple mapping targets a single precomposed code point rather than a decomposed sequence, is mapped only to its simple, single-code-point uppercase form.
